Spec: Assets

Purpose:
  Bundled map styles, app icon, activity icons and the countdown voice clips.

Owns:
  ./map/retrail_light.json
  ./map/retrail_dark.json
  ./branding
  ./icons
  ./audio/countdown

References:
  /tool/tool.sdd
  /docs/specs/history/design-tokens.md

Must:
  The map styles are generated by `/tool/build_map_styles.dart`; colours change there, never in the JSON.
  The countdown clips are generated by `/tool/generate_countdown_clips.sh` with a paid Azure Speech tier
    (S0), never the free tier; the source and licence are in `audio/countdown/README.md`.
  `branding/app_icon.png` (full-bleed square, no alpha), `app_icon_foreground.png` and
    `app_icon_monochrome.png` (the mark inside the `66` dp safe zone of the `108` dp canvas, no inset)
    are the launcher sources; `dart run flutter_launcher_icons` regenerates the platform icons from them.
  `branding/retrail_mark.png` is the only branding image the app bundles; it works on the light and the
    dark surface.
